                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "357966bb-3220-4e18-9001-e677177e8b86",
                        "entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "broekies"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                        "entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "een jong onervaren jochie"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "informal"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "95644458-047e-419e-8954-479cff079cf1",
                                "sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                                "text": "Ook over zijn ploeg was Dumoulin niets dan lovend. \"Iedereen heeft heel goed gewerkt. Sam (Oomen, red.), die als jong broekie zelf nog negende wordt. Laurens (Ten Dam, red.), de oude krijger die lang meegaat in de bergen\", aldus Dumoulin."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eeab60ba-ac84-4355-b8b8-d8c0d960221a",
                                "sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                                "text": "Maar opnieuw was het Erwin Komenda – toen nog lang niet toe aan zijn laatste pakje peuken – die het ontwerp van de 911 al grotendeels klaar had toen broekie Butzi van de ontwerpschool was gestuurd en werd opgevangen door zijn vader."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c20a879c-6239-4c06-9f75-9fe63ff8e098",
                                "sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                                "text": "Als 19-jarig broekie werd hij in 1949 samen met nog negenhonderd dienstplichtige militairen ingescheept aan boord van de tot troepenschip omgebouwde vrachtboot Tabinta. Ruim een maand deed Henk Wansink (88) uit Eibergen er over om met het schip de 17.000 kilometer naar Nederlands-Indië te overbruggen."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1b062587-2c08-337c-a7ec-470aa52b5ca1",
                        "entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "glosses": [
                            "broekje"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": []
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fc6565cc-8a41-4834-af90-729e71eb78a9",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                        "source_sense_description": "jonge man",
                        "target_lang_word": "whippersnapper",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "whippersnapper",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31d7815e-03ed-3cc3-ac5d-253c8823aa97",
                                        "entry_id": "eae13369-1888-3f37-90b1-d2af9f1cc744",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young and cheeky or presumptuous person; often with a connotation of ignorance via inexperience."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "colloquial"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ad9238ca-b878-4848-9b6b-2b4e27a1cc80",
                                                "sense_id": "31d7815e-03ed-3cc3-ac5d-253c8823aa97",
                                                "text": "These whippersnappers have never had to walk far or carry water."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d76064ad-f977-4296-b8e3-2cda3c303d79",
                                                "sense_id": "31d7815e-03ed-3cc3-ac5d-253c8823aa97",
                                                "text": "\"Throw me a nine iron Fatman, I want to make sure of getting inside you young whippersnappers.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20879719-5e21-4009-ab38-1ade7e39c2c7",
                                                "sense_id": "31d7815e-03ed-3cc3-ac5d-253c8823aa97",
                                                "text": "Eisenhower thought that the President-elect, his junior by over 25 years, was merely a \"young whippersnapper.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c5538d8d-515a-46f9-a03c-4680aa840903",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                        "source_sense_description": "jonge man",
                        "target_lang_word": "young person",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": []
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "743cfdac-5753-4fa2-b126-dc17bdbda538",
                        "source_entry_id": "5b2d7ff2-4c98-38fe-b41e-a4d9b5a096b3",
                        "source_sense_id": "faab458f-c542-31db-9259-3b329f8d0148",
                        "source_sense_description": "jonge man",
                        "target_lang_word": "youngster",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "youngster",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "49ebe799-1222-39bc-89ca-ec83311463fa",
                                        "entry_id": "877e85c0-37f6-37e6-beba-fec7b3f31ca4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young person."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c2a3f9a1-04ef-4319-9f9b-8a6a838695f4",
                                                "sense_id": "49ebe799-1222-39bc-89ca-ec83311463fa",
                                                "text": "As soon as Julia returned with a constable, Timothy, who was on the point of exhaustion, prepared to give over to him gratefully. The newcomer turned out to be a powerful youngster, fully trained and eager to help, and he stripped off his tunic at once."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4eaed8e2-9067-4ef9-9a16-889102173336",
                                                "sense_id": "49ebe799-1222-39bc-89ca-ec83311463fa",
                                                "text": "‘Cook-housekeeper jobs don’t grow on trees,’ went on the woman, ‘leastways not where you can keep a youngster with you.’ [...] ‘Do you mean,’ stammered Jess, ‘that you are . . .?’ ‘Cook-housekeeper,’ the woman nodded. ‘Aren’t I telling you? It’s all confirmed!’ ‘And the youngster – me?’ asked Jessamy. ‘Well, whoever else you silly child!’ said the housekeeper, smiling."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0ea8b795-c75c-4b84-a5f8-c14f76c86c91",
                                                "sense_id": "49ebe799-1222-39bc-89ca-ec83311463fa",
                                                "text": "“Besides,” she says, looking possessively at her class of Chinese youngsters, “can you imagine these children going to an ordinary school?”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8186f84e-ac74-43b2-89ab-7875d2ac7cae",
                                                "sense_id": "49ebe799-1222-39bc-89ca-ec83311463fa",
                                                "text": "In a single moment Montenegro and their supporters were given fresh impetus and encouragement. Beciraj tested Hart with a low shot before teenager Phil Jones, on his England debut, suffered an anxious moment when Stevan Jovetic went down under his challenge, leaving the youngster clearly relieved to see referee Stark wave away Montenegro's appeals."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
